{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_title", "source_sha256": "a8b3073a41525b55f53a708cec442232451d3c76d9c941a8209433825299943a", "ja": "ロコモーション、リノベーション", "zh": "ROCO情绪、翻新", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2be10cf493f7b6249b228a486300a9d3f7225924987964d1405ea9ceb51c7707", "ja": "プロデューサーがロコの新曲を用意するが、\nロコと杏奈はゲームの事でケンカ中。レッス\nンが始まりメンバーと触れ合う中で、少しず\nつ素直になっていく。公演当日、ステージ袖\nには仲良くケンカするふたりの姿があった。", "zh": "制作人准备了ROCO的新歌，\n但ROCO和杏奈正因为游戏的事吵架中。\n随着课程开始，在与成员们的接触中，\n她们渐渐变得坦率起来。公演当天，舞台侧面\n出现了两个人吵吵闹闹、感情依旧很好的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "35c9dc330e9879111d4e8f513f5470f321abd21504c69414864dc8fc280ee9c7", "ja": "オーディエンスのみんな！\nロコの新曲、どうでしたか？", "zh": "各位观众！\n觉得ROCO的新歌怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "6eabc4cac68c99e00f7e3b28c622556309f0524f2523639987f50945d2e80bc7", "ja": "ワアアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "a71e0dc94bf1ba885ebabec529d54c592be3278b06617475a7d04ed773567e85", "ja": "公演メンバーのみんなも、本当にサンクスです♪\n最高のパフォーマンスでした！", "zh": "公演成员们也真的非常感谢♪\n刚才的表演太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "6eabc4cac68c99e00f7e3b28c622556309f0524f2523639987f50945d2e80bc7", "ja": "ワアアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "624c6f430ed69ea05662d545de9620a3badf1469949f9ca8bd561ef1327f645c", "ja": "でも実はライブ前、いろんなことがあったんです。\n……ロコが、アンナとケンカしちゃったりとか。", "zh": "不过其实，在演唱会前发生了很多事情。\n……比如说，ROCO和安娜吵了一架什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "82a23d6cb644802d8ec2234bc234fa2ef5eac5022345fc5f8b663f20d34d44cd", "ja": "えっ……！\nそれ、ここで言っちゃうの！？", "zh": "诶……！\n那个要在这里说出来吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "43c759a41d16706eb6da95a1b1a0e58d89be0154a9d5d9b9a2a5fd6f3f43b01c", "ja": "はい！　だって……\nおかげで、大切なことに気づけたから！", "zh": "是的！因为……多亏了这个，我才意识到了一件重要的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "519f7d6751489fc60f9242a0d18c480b5fba410f475ce904772a69b86444c380", "ja": "アイドルのステージって、本当にマーベラスです！\nえへへ♪　今日は本当にサンクスでしたー！", "zh": "偶像的舞台真的精彩绝伦！\n嘿嘿♪ 今天真的非常感谢啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1008_audience", "source_sha256": "6eabc4cac68c99e00f7e3b28c622556309f0524f2523639987f50945d2e80bc7", "ja": "ワアアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1009_p", "source_sha256": "df24d9dbffff07376cc0a6d552d1052d182dc694b78a6064ffa7ced285c2e98c", "ja": "お疲れさま、ロコ。いいライブだったな！\n新曲もバッチリだったぞ！", "zh": "辛苦了，ROCO。刚才的演出很棒啊！\n新歌也发挥得非常好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "174d23658cb19a5da0ce4c277e43e86f27c0f6c6baedcd0f887e4a91c85907e8", "ja": "はいっ！　ロコも、ベストを尽くせたって思います！\n{$P$}のおかげですね♪", "zh": "是！我觉得ROCO也发挥出了最佳水平！\n这都多亏了{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "bc7b070bada5ae9dc5c54d013cbf68b00ac0ba3e3a2cd1520188ce52fe2f7d19", "ja": "本当に素敵だったわ！\n杏奈ちゃんとの息もピッタリだったし♪", "zh": "真的非常精彩！\n和杏奈的配合也天衣无缝♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "b86bfd76d2d4452a8ac2821051ea2a400327a97016f5c6ac31286a13034e3232", "ja": "そうね、客席もすっごく盛り上がってたわ！\nま、伊織ちゃんのMCのおかげでもあるけど♪", "zh": "是啊，观众席也热闹得不得了！\n嘛，这也多亏了伊织的MC啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "72c5b3de7e3b1bac297ab4a3f1ac4a13e004d9d2e3e2a36e32b641df9887e0ba", "ja": "しっかりロコに繋げられてよかったね、伊織！\nふたりでいっぱいMCの練習した甲斐があったよ～。", "zh": "能顺利衔接到ROCO真是太好了，伊织！\n我们俩一起认真练习MC，果然没有白费呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "15f89d89c1970f815d4a11f4238a1d3fbf8b19f9acbbb55732b784aca52cfbd3", "ja": "そ……、そうね、まあまあ練習した甲斐はあったわ！", "zh": "是……是啊，看来练了那么多还是有价值的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "08b0cd938bf0aae2c45dc9e8dcfd37d87fb6a6f209711e12eda9a43ae78df1ca", "ja": "おかげでロコはパーフェクトなステージが\nできました。イオリ、マコト、サンクスです！", "zh": "多亏了你们，ROCO完成了完美的舞台。伊织、真，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "a05dd5586174a42f9c3249af98ec2758e83b8b9551bce4ef87f6eb571e7c495d", "ja": "ロコ、ステップ間違ってた、よ……。\nパーフェクトじゃ、ない……。", "zh": "ROCO，舞步跳错了……  \n不完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "c00a1a93b837ddc1b4a006524e54cf53c293276fcbe7af255b27505ea09345ff", "ja": "えっ、どこですか！？\nというか、よく見てますね、アンナ？", "zh": "诶，哪里错了！？话说回来，你看得真仔细啊，杏奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "57e85b56a8e96753564274a324e61386b1f32df9878795c313b1118f30d0e11f", "ja": "それに、突然ケンカのこと、言って……。\n杏奈、準備してなくて……困った……。", "zh": "而且，还突然提起吵架的事……  \n杏奈一点准备都没有……好困扰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "f16d8b71b8c52e1882ac60c317d9a5aa9b449323e43388aad3efbcf218870a1d", "ja": "あ、あれはその……、オーディエンスに\nロコ達のサクセスのファクターを伝えたくて～。", "zh": "啊、那个是……我只是想把ROCO们成功的关键因素传达给观众～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "e6ae4ccb84718c1f7133950e2ebda3331408b9a48660bc53381c14d7ab8134e3", "ja": "それに、フラッシュアイディアをアクチュアライズして\nこそ、イノベーションは生まれるってロコは思います！", "zh": "而且，只有将灵光一现的点子付诸实践，创新才会诞生！ROCO是这么想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b5ba8135bb59c268edc7306625f6d5bbeb6bc2ae7e19cf1828f3b3390b09dcc", "ja": "ん……よくわかんないから、戻る、ね。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈听不太懂，这就回去、了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "d8c79f156ae81da1d19d59990a15196b5f80562c52c7177805a507c122317df5", "ja": "そんな！　ちょ、聞いてください、アンナ～！", "zh": "怎么这样！等、请听我说，安娜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "b6de0a38f657a44d81e59e609cd4e2c448dd12d053edd87db9fb5c5b44d21e12", "ja": "あはは、これも仲がいい証拠……だといいけど。\nさて、ボクも着替えてこようっと。", "zh": "啊哈哈，这也是我们关系好的证明……就好了。  \n好了，我也去换衣服啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1024_007ior", "source_sha256": "3e79184d9769deeaaae60df51c9606873401eba3d023f4fc0669117bc7e1bdfc", "ja": "あ、そうだわ！\n杏奈、あのゲーム、今日こそやらせてもらえるの？", "zh": "啊，对了！\n杏奈，今天总能让我玩那个游戏了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "52f0c1079dbaddbbdcc24d2d489fcc9d6de5070fcf336334514d7bb1656b6e57", "ja": "ウフフ。みんなまだまだ元気そうね。\nさて、私達も戻りましょうか。", "zh": "呵呵，大家看起来还是很有精神呢。\n好了，我们也回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2f38bc15d4f416909a95903623973c0e50a8f25a9e8f6a00f827387e181811bb", "ja": "……よかった。ロコ、杏奈とはしっかり\n仲直りできたんだな。", "zh": "……太好了。ROCO，你和杏奈好好\n和好了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1027_025roc", "source_sha256": "34094f9cc275ab3fcf7226a0945e22544694288f5122f5ca8f377cc35f61643f", "ja": "え、そうですか？\nロコは今、ちょっと心配になってたんですけど……？", "zh": "诶，是吗？ROCO刚才还有点担心来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c9c5fe9aa1aba14e96ce66f46be4a97eb88761442033d4ef1fa6936c26e03f0f", "ja": "どうかな。包み隠さないそのままの気持ちを\n口に出せるのは、スゴイことだと思うよ。", "zh": "怎么样。我觉得能毫不掩饰地说出自己真实的想法，是一件很了不起的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "450668f07493c4d7bad2209ce0331fca579aa82c2dac5b075c53f7e458f3b2b8", "ja": "そのままの気持ち……えへへ、そうかもしれませんね。\nそんな風にいってもらえると、ロコも嬉しいです。", "zh": "原本的心情……嘿嘿，或许真是这样呢。\n能听到你这么说，ROCO也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "0d86e1158cecd36ce1b9c82e2549b0c29a41d78a60a24a1ed62c8c556e6dbf69", "ja": "今回はみんなのおかげで、ロコズワールドを、\nアトラクティブにリノベーションできたって思います。", "zh": "这次多亏了大家，我觉得成功把ROCO世界改造成更有吸引力的样子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "813dd0f13498ac0682b4696f8b8befe546dc4a30e85eb548dfb13c34e7803f98", "ja": "{$P$}、ベリーサンクスでした！\nここから先のキャンバスにも……。", "zh": "{$P$}，非常感谢！接下来的画布也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "90781428cbb3248d5dee4511209190535b081732c5966119fcdda6c2f9b4c33f", "ja": "ロコに、とびっきりのアートを描かせてくださいね♪", "zh": "请让ROCO画出最棒的艺术作品吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_074_1033_p", "source_sha256": "2c8d239cf1fbed840637e8dd3d4287996657dff00a53b60e4fe1ea3dad388de6", "ja": "ああ。もちろんだ、ロコ。この劇場で、\nみんなで一緒に、大きな絵を描いていこうな！", "zh": "啊，当然了，ROCO。我们大家一起，在这个剧场里画一幅大大的画吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
